<title>HUNGARY: MOL H1 '97 IAS GROUP NET INCOME 12.545 BLN.</title>
<headline>MOL H1 '97 IAS GROUP NET INCOME 12.545 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-June 1997  Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit     21,482.8   vs    14,820.4</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	 16,088.5   vs    10,525.5</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit     13,535.8   vs    10,066.6</p>
<p>    Group net income	     12,544.5   vs    10,688.9</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     296,956.0   vs   239,216.6</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	   4,948.7   vs     6,501.0</p>
<p>    Material-type expend.     190,078.1   vs   159,506.0</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures     21,568.7   vs    17,521.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation, amortization 17,452.0   vs    11,383.9</p>
<p>    Other costs		     9,766.5   vs    10,695.0</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   43,792.0   vs    34,019.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  5,394.3 loss vs  4,294.9 loss</p>
<p>	 Financial revenue	  2,840.6   vs     1,790.5</p>
<p>	 Financial expense	  8,235.0   vs     6,085.3</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	  0.0   vs	   0.0</p>
<p>    Taxation			  2,552.7   vs	 458.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Magyar Olaj- es Gazipari Rt (MOL) is an oil and gas</p>
<p>company. The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were</p>
<p>calculated in accordance with International Accounting</p>
<p>Standards.</p>
